  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/YcHt7gaDdm\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的 Discord</a>&nbsp;</strong></h2>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>---------資訊---------</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Create: The Factory Must Grow 是一款旨在將 Create 擴展至柴油與電力時代的模組。如果您對由電線供電、以大型柴油引擎驅動的大型冒煙工廠感興趣，那麼這個擴充模組正是為您而設！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>我們的部分功能包括：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>可自訂汽缸配置的柴油、汽油、LPG 及其他引擎！</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>具備電壓系統的獨特電力機制！（兼容 FE）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>凝固汽油彈、噴火器、管道炸彈及其他武器！</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>石油及其煉製技術！</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>鋼、硫磺、鋁、鉛等更多材料！</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>混凝土、空心磚、支撐結構等更多建築方塊！</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>還有更多內容！</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">---------其他專案---------</span></strong></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/industrialized-architecture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Create：工業化建築</span></strong></a></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/industrialized-architecture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/693815/description_0f3cd13b-5c65-416c-816f-b6446d5398d4.png\" alt=\"Create：工業化建築\" width=\"340\" height=\"340\"></a><br><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br></strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:36px\">---------伺服器託管---------</span></strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/262afb89-b159-42bc-b108-1866574c8ef6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"413\" height=\"253\"></a><br></strong></span></h3>\n<h5>&nbsp;</h5>\n<h5>&nbsp;</h5>\n<h5>&nbsp;</h5>\n<h5>在伺服器託管方面，我始終信賴 BisectHosting。新客戶可使用優惠碼 DrMangoTea 在第一個月購買遊戲伺服器時節省 25%，其專屬支援團隊全天候 24/7 為您提供頂級協助。</h5>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br><br></strong></span></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
